.TH LSPCI 1 "2026" "KERNEL32" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lspci \- liste les peripheriques PCI et USB / list PCI and USB devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lspci

.br
.B lsusb

.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read /sys/bus/pci/devices and /sys/bus/usb/devices (vendor, device, class, product, manufacturer).
.SH SEE ALSO
lsmod(1)
